-- Course: Master of Technology, Innovation and Entrepreneurship (115964C)
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>The Master of Technology, Innovation and Entrepreneurship equips you to lead the future of business and technology. </p><p>Gain advanced skills in innovation management, commercialisation and entrepreneurial thinking. Evolve unique ideas into impactful ventures. Learn how to identify emerging opportunities, integrate AI-driven strategies and steer new product development from concept to market success. </p><p>This degree combines business insight and technological ability, preparing you to shift complex challenges into creative solutions. Develop your ability to lead projects, influence stakeholders and transform industries. </p><p>Graduates are ready to launch innovative startups, drive transformation in established companies or consult on the latest technological trends. </p><p>Be part of a new wave of leaders shaping industries and creating sustainable, forward-thinking solutions for a changing world. </p>',
