 8.7</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>English Proficiency</strong></td><td><ul><li>International students who speak English as an additional language must have obtained one of the following standards within the last two years prior to admission</li><li>IELTS Overall 7, Reading 7, Listening 7, Speaking 7, Writing 7</li><li>Equivalent English qualifications accepted — see Adelaide University link for comprehensive list</li><li>Where previous study/work experience was conducted in English, application must be accompanied by certified documentation from educational institution/employer certifying language of instruction/employment was English</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Other</strong></td><td><ul><li>In cases where there are more eligible applicants than available places, admission will be competitive with ranks based on the entry criteria</li><li>Possession of qualifications in addition to academic entry requirements does not guarantee a place; applications considered individually and selection is competitive</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>',
