-- Course: Bachelor of Pharmacy (Honours) (115744D)
UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p>Become a vital part of the healthcare system that makes a real difference in people''s lives. The Bachelor of Pharmacy (Honours) will ensure you graduate with a competitive edge. Step into clinical practice and learn in our state-of-the-art pharmacy laboratory.</p><p>Gain 12-weeks practical experience in community pharmacies and hospitals. Build networks to accelerate your career aspirations. Learn how to dispense medicines, counsel patients and deliver quality care. You’ll acquire the skills needed for contemporary pharmacy practice.</p><p>Benefit from our strong links with clinical practice and the community. Work alongside experienced clinicians, award-winning researchers and academics. Develop technical expertise and essential skills to effectively collaborate with other healthcare professionals.</p><p>Improve lives in one of the world''s most trusted and in-demand professions.</p>',
    course_duration_per_week = 208,
    total_course_duration = '4 year(s) full-time',
    offshore_tuition_fee = 52200,
