 / Global America College Test (ACT) 26</li><li>USA / Global Scholastic Assessment Test (SAT) 1220</li><li>Vietnam Bằng Tốt Nghiệp Trung Học Phổ Thông (Vietnamese Year 12) 8.5</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td><strong>English Proficiency</strong></td><td><ul><li>International students who speak English as an additional language must have obtained one of the following standards within the last two years prior to admission</li><li>IELTS Overall 7, Reading 7, Listening 7, Speaking 7, Writing 7</li><li>Equivalent English qualifications link available from Adelaide University</li><li>Where previous study/work experience was conducted in English, the application must be accompanied by certified documentation from the educational institution/employer certifying that the language of instruction/employment was English</li><li>Possession of English qualifications in addition to academic entry requirements does not guarantee a place; applications considered individually and selection is competitive</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table>',
